Description: OpenSesame plugin for Tobii eye trackers through Titta
 This plugin for the OpenSesame experiment builder calibrates
 and records Tobii eye trackers through Titta, with items for
 calibration, recording, messages, gaze plotting and saving the
 data. It needs the PsychoPy backend.
